<view class="story-page"><view wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}" class="hint">{{loadingDetail}}</view><view wx:if="{{state === 'ready'}}" class="hint">这张照片，已经续写成一个小故事</view><view wx:if="{{state === 'failed'}}" class="hint error">{{errorMessage}}</view><view class="story-card"><image src="{{generatedImageUrl || photoPath}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}" class="loading-mask"><view class="loader"></view><view class="loading-title">{{loadingTitle}}</view><view>{{loadingDetail}}</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{state === 'ready'}}"><button class="save" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">{{saved ? '已保存，去分享' : '保存并分享'}}</button><button class="again" bindtap="regenerate">换一个故事</button></block><view wx:if="{{state === 'failed'}}" class="failed">本次没有生成成功，不会扣除创作次数。请返回后重新选择照片再试。</view></view>
